OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Ffading away through the evening to
OL,7,Fleave sunny then clear spells. Cloud
OL,8,Fand occasionally heavy rain will
OL,9,Fspread east through the early hours.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FCloudy with occasionally heavy
OL,12,Frain at first, this clearing east in
OL,13,Fthe morning. Then mainly dry with
OL,14,Fbright or warm sunny spells and just
OL,15,Fthe odd light shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
