OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells or sunny spells over the
OL,7,Fweekend, mainly dry but the odd light
OL,8,Fshower possible in the west. Dry start
OL,9,FMonday but likely turning wet and
OL,10,Fwindy later.
